# Milestone 4: Live Context Injection for Agents

## Objective

Let supported agents receive relevant context during real work while keeping generated files as the stable fallback.

## Backlog Item AK-INJECT-001: Add context endpoint

### User Story

As an agent integration, I want to request a compact context block for a session, files, and task, so I can inject only useful local guidance.

### Endpoint

```text
