### Pattern Signals

1. Same error text
2. Same command
3. Same file
4. Same root cause
5. Same fix
6. Same agent repeating the same mistake

### Acceptance Criteria

1. Patterns are generated locally
2. No LLM required
3. Results are explainable
4. User can promote a pattern to proposal
5. False positives are easy to reject

